{"id":"fa_brica","lemma":"fábrica","pos":"noun","rank":1534,"glosses":["factory"],"ipa":"/ˈfabɾika/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"fábricas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-f%C3%A1brica.wav","examples":[{"text":"Trabajamos en una fábrica.","en":"We work in a factory.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454379"},{"text":"En Kawasaki hay muchas fábricas.","en":"There are a lot of factories in Kawasaki.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692667"},{"text":"Trabaja en una fábrica.","en":"He works in a factory.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/103733"},{"text":"Las fábricas están produciendo en grande.","en":"The factories are producing on a large scale."},{"text":"Vayamos a la fábrica.","en":"Let's go to the factory.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594478"}]}